[{"type":"TypeService","id":160301105712131000,"publishStartDate":1456829832322,"publishEndDate":1457866632322,"Image":"announcement_APP","SmallImage":"announcement_816x128_App","fontSize":24,"titleId":"CUH-App","descriptionId":"CUB-App","descriptionId2":null,"descriptionId3":null,"descriptionId4":null,"title":{"ja":"新しいDRIVECLUB™ Appが登場!","en_US":"New DRIVECLUB™ App!","fr":"Nouvelle application DRIVECLUB™ !","es":"¡Nueva aplicación DRIVECLUB™!","de":"Neue DRIVECLUB™-App!","it":"Nuova app di DRIVECLUB™!","nl":"Nieuwe DRIVECLUB™-app!","pt":"Nova aplicação do DRIVECLUB™!","ru":"Новое приложение DRIVECLUB™!","ko":"새로운 DRIVECLUB™ 앱!","zh":"全新 DRIVECLUB™ 應用程式！","zh_CN":"全新 DRIVECLUB™ 应用程序！","fi":"Uusi DRIVECLUB™-sovellus!","sv":"Ny DRIVECLUB™-app!","da":"Ny DRIVECLUB™-app!","no":"Ny DRIVECLUB™-app!","pl":"Nowa DRIVECLUB™ App!","pt_BR":"Novo aplicativo DRIVECLUB™!","en":"New DRIVECLUB™ App!","tr":"Yeni DRIVECLUB™ Uygulaması!","es_MX":"¡Nueva aplicación DRIVECLUB™!","fr_CA":"Nouvelle application DRIVECLUB™ !","ar":"New DRIVECLUB™ App!"},"description":{"ja":"チャレンジの情報がいつでもどこでもチェックできちゃう無料のDRIVECLUB™ AppがiOSとAndroidに登場!\r\n\r\nゲットするには表示されているQRコードをスキャンまたは、Google Play および App Storeから検索してください。","en_US":"Keep up to speed with your Challenges whenever you want and wherever you are with the free DRIVECLUB™ App, now available for your iOS and Android devices.\r\n\r\nTo get the app right now you can either scan the QR code shown here with your device or you can search for the app directly within the Google Play Store and the Apple App Store.","fr":"Gardez un œil sur vos défis DRIVECLUB™ où vous le souhaitez, quand vous le souhaitez, avec l'application DRIVECLUB™, disponible sur les appareils iOS et Android.\r\n\r\nPour obtenir l'application dès maintenant, vous pouvez scanner le code QR ici présent avec votre appareil ou effectuer directement une recherche sur le Google Play Store ou l'App Store d'Apple.","es":"Mantente al día de tus desafíos donde y cuando quieras con la aplicación DRIVECLUB™ gratuita, ya disponible para dispositivos iOS y Android.\r\n\r\nPara conseguir la aplicación ya mismo, puedes usar tu dispositivo para escanear el código QR que aparece aquí, o bien buscar la aplicación directamente en Google Play y en el App Store de Apple.","de":"Bleib bei deinen Herausforderungen auf dem Laufenden, wann immer du möchtest und wo immer du bist – mit der kostenlosen DRIVECLUB™-App, jetzt verfügbar für iOS und Android-Geräte.\r\n\r\nUm dir die App gleich jetzt zu holen, kannst du entweder den gezeigten QR-Code mit deinem Gerät scannen oder die App direkt im Google Play Store und Apple App Store suchen.","it":"Mantieni alta la velocità nelle tue sfide, dove vuoi e quando vuoi, grazie all'app gratuita di DRIVECLUB™, ora disponibile per dispositivi iOS e Android.\r\n\r\nPer ottenere subito l'app puoi scansionare il codice QR qui riportato con il tuo dispositivo o cercare l'app direttamente nel Google Play Store o nell'App Store di Apple.","nl":"Hou je uitdagingen bij wanneer je wilt en waar je ook bent met de DRIVECLUB™-app zonder bijkomende kosten, nu verkrijgbaar voor je iOS- en Android-apparaten.\r\n\r\nOm de app meteen te installeren kun je de QR-code die je hier ziet scannen met je apparaat, of je kunt de app opzoeken in de Google Play Store of de Apple App Store.","pt":"Mantém-te a par dos teus Desafios sempre que quiseres e em qualquer lugar com a aplicação gratuita do DRIVECLUB™, já disponível para os dispositivos iOS e Android.\r\n\r\nPara receberes a aplicação de imediato podes usar o teu dispositivo para ler o código QR aqui exibido ou procurar a aplicação diretamente no Google Play ou na App Store.","ru":"Следите за своими испытаниями всегда и везде с бесплатным приложением DRIVECLUB™ для мобильных устройств на базе iOS и Android.\r\n\r\nЧтобы загрузить это приложение, просканируйте показанный здесь QR-код с помощью своего устройства. Кроме того, вы можете найти приложение непосредственно в магазине Google Play или Apple App Store.","ko":"무료 DRIVECLUB™ 앱으로 언제 어디서든 챌린지를 관리하세요. 이제 iOS와 안드로이드 장치에서 사용할 수 있습니다.\r\n\r\n바로 앱을 받으시려면 여기 있는 QR 코드를 스캔하거나 Google Play 스토어나 Apple 앱 스토어에서 앱을 검색하시면 됩니다.","zh":"無論何時何地，只要你想，利用免費的 DRIVECLUB™ 應用程式便可跟上你的挑戰賽進度！應用程式現已可在 iOS 和 Android 裝置上全面上線！\r\n\r\n要立即獲得應用程式，可以使用裝置掃描此處顯示的 QR 碼立即獲取，也可直接在 Google Play 商店和 Apple 應用商店中直接搜索獲得。","zh_CN":"无论何时何地，只要你想，利用免费的 DRIVECLUB™ 应用程序便可跟上你的挑战赛进度！应用程序现已可在 iOS 和 Android 设备上全面上线！\r\n\r\n要立即获得应用程序，可以使用设备扫描此处显示的二维码立即获取，也可直接在 Google Play 商店和 Apple 应用商店中直接搜索获得。","fi":"Hanki ilmainen DRIVECLUB™-sovellus, niin pysyt ajan tasalla haasteistasi milloin haluat ja missä sitten oletkin. Saatavilla nyt iOS- ja Android-laitteille.\r\n\r\nJos tahdot hankkia sovelluksen nyt heti, voit joko skannata tässä näkyvän QR-koodin laitteellasi tai hakea sen suoraan Google Play -kaupasta tai Apple App Store -kaupasta.","sv":"Håll full koll på dina utmaningar när som helst och var som helst med den kostnadsfria DRIVECLUB™-appen, ute nu till iOS- och Android-enheter.\r\n\r\nFör att hämta appen direkt kan du skanna den här QR-koden med din enhet, eller söka efter appen i Google Play Store eller Apple App Store.","da":"Hold styr på dine udfordringer når som helst og hvor som helst med den gratis DRIVECLUB™-app, der nu fås til dine iOS- og Android-enheder.\r\n\r\nDu kan få appen lige nu ved enten at scanne den her QR-kode eller ved at søge efter den i Google Play Store eller Apple App Store.","no":"Hold deg oppdatert på utfordringene dine når du ønsker, og uansett hvor du er, med den gratis DRIVECLUB™-appen, som nå er tilgjengelig for iOS- og Android-enheter.\r\n\r\nFor å skaffe deg appen med en gang kan du enten lese av denne QR-koden med enheten din, eller så kan du søke etter appen i Google Play Butikk eller Apple App Store.","pl":"Dzięki nowej, darmowej DRIVECLUB™ App, już dostępnej na iOS i Android, będziesz mógł sprawdzać wyzwania kiedykolwiek i gdziekolwiek zechcesz.\r\n\r\nAby pobrać aplikację, zeskanuj kod QR albo znajdź ją w Google Play Store bądź Apple App Store.","pt_BR":"Mantenha-se informado sobre seus desafios sempre que quiser e onde estiver com o aplicativo gratuito DRIVECLUB™, já disponível para seus dispositivos iOS e Android.\r\n\r\nPara obter o aplicativo agora mesmo você pode usar a câmera do seu dispositivo no código QR mostrado aqui ou procurar pelo aplicativo diretamente dentro da Play Store do Google e da App Store da Apple.","en":"Keep up to speed with your Challenges whenever you want and wherever you are with the free DRIVECLUB™ App, now available for your iOS and Android devices.\r\n\r\nTo get the app right now you can either scan the QR code shown here with your device or you can search for the app directly within the Google Play Store and the Apple App Store.","tr":"Şimdi iOS ve Android cihazlarında kullanıma sunulmuş olan ücretsiz DRIVECLUB™ uygulaması ile istediğiniz yerde, istediğiniz zaman Kapışmalarınızı takip edin.\r\n\r\nUygulamayı hemen edinmek için cihazınızla burada gösterilen QR kodunu tarayabilir ya da uygulamayı doğrudan Google Play Store ve Apple App Store'da aratabilirsiniz.","es_MX":"Mantente al día de tus desafíos donde y cuando quieras con la aplicación DRIVECLUB™ gratuita, ya disponible para dispositivos iOS y Android.\r\n\r\nPara conseguir la aplicación ya mismo, puedes usar tu dispositivo para escanear el código QR que aparece aquí, o bien buscar la aplicación directamente en Google Play y en la App Store de Apple.","fr_CA":"Gardez un œil sur vos défis DRIVECLUB™ où vous le souhaitez, quand vous le souhaitez, avec l'application DRIVECLUB™, disponible sur les appareils iOS et Android.\r\n\r\nPour obtenir l'application dès maintenant, vous pouvez scanner le code QR ici présent avec votre appareil ou effectuer directement une recherche sur le Google Play Store ou l'App Store d'Apple.","ar":"Keep up to speed with your Challenges whenever you want and wherever you are with the free DRIVECLUB™ App, now available for your iOS and Android devices.\r\n\r\nTo get the app right now you can either scan the QR code shown here with your device or you can search for the app directly within the Google Play Store and the Apple App Store."}},{"type":"TypeAlert","id":160302110515021100,"publishStartDate":1456923600176,"publishEndDate":1458046800176,"Image":"announcement_Ferrari599xx","SmallImage":"announcement_816x128_Ferrari599xx","fontSize":24,"titleId":"CUH-2XFAME","descriptionId":"CUB-2XP_hyper","descriptionId2":null,"descriptionId3":null,"descriptionId4":null,"title":{"ja":"名声ポイント2倍!","en_US":"DOUBLE FAME!","fr":"RÉPUTATION DOUBLE !","es":"¡DOBLE FAMA!","de":"DOPPELTER RUHM!","it":"DOPPIA FAMA!","nl":"DUBBELE ROEM!","pt":"PRESTÍGIO DUPLO!","ru":"УДВОЕНИЕ СЛАВЫ!","ko":"명성 2배!","zh":"雙倍聲望！","zh_CN":"双倍声望！","fi":"TUPLAMAINE!","sv":"DUBBEL BERÖMMELSE!","da":"DOBBELT BERØMMELSE!","no":"DOBBELT MED RYKTEPOENG!","pl":"PODWÓJNA SŁAWA!","pt_BR":"FAMA DUPLA!","en":"DOUBLE FAME!","tr":"İKİ KAT ÜN!","es_MX":"¡DOBLE FAMA!","fr_CA":"RÉPUTATION DOUBLE !","ar":"DOUBLE FAME!"},"description":{"ja":"ハイパーマシン使用時の名声ポイントが2倍もらえます!","en_US":"Driving Hyper cars will earn you DOUBLE Fame!","fr":"Pilotez une hypercar pour gagner le DOUBLE de réputation !","es":"¡Si conduces hiperdeportivos ganarás el DOBLE de Fama!","de":"Beim Fahren von Hyper-Autos verdienst du DOPPELTEN Ruhm!","it":"Questo weekend, tutte le auto Iper ottengono DOPPIA fama!","nl":"Dit weekend verdien je met alle hypercars DUBBELE roem!","pt":"Os carros Hiper ganham Prestígio a DOBRAR!","ru":"Все машины класса \"Гипер\" приносят УДВОЕННУЮ славу!","ko":"하이퍼 클래스 자동차로 운전하면 명성을 2배로 획득할 수 있습니다!","zh":"駕駛高級超跑車輛將可在這個週末獲得雙倍聲望！","zh_CN":"驾驶高级超跑将可在这个周末获得双倍声望！","fi":"Hyperautoilla ajamalla ansaitsee KAKSINKERTAISEN määrän mainetta!","sv":"Kör Hyperbilar och få DUBBEL berömmelse!","da":"Du får dobbelt så meget berømmelse for at køre i hyperbiler!","no":"Du får DOBLE ryktepoeng hvis du kjører hyperbiler!","pl":"Jazda za kierownicą samochodów klasy hiper sprawi, że otrzymasz podwójną liczbę pkt sławy!","pt_BR":"Dirigir Hiper Carros vai lhe dar Fama DUPLA!","en":"Driving Hyper cars will earn you DOUBLE Fame!","tr":"Hiper otomobilleri sürmek size ÇİFTE Ün kazandıracak!","es_MX":"¡Si conduces hiperdeportivos ganarás el DOBLE de Fama!","fr_CA":"Pilotez une hypercar pour gagner le DOUBLE de réputation !","ar":"Driving Hyper cars will earn you DOUBLE Fame!"}},{"type":"TypeAlert","id":160322130000291300,"publishStartDate":1458651600660,"publishEndDate":1459252800660,"Image":"announcement_KoenigseggOne","SmallImage":"announcement_816x128_KoenigseggOne","fontSize":24,"titleId":"CUH-DoubleFame","descriptionId":"","descriptionId2":"","descriptionId3":"","descriptionId4":"","title":{"ja":"名声ポイント2倍イベント!","en_US":"Double Fame Event!","fr":"Événement Réputation double","es":"¡Evento de doble Fama!","de":"„Doppelter Ruhm“-Veranstaltung!","it":"Evento doppia fama!","nl":"Dubbele-roem-event!","pt":"Evento de Prestígio a Dobrar!","ru":"Заезд с удвоенной славой!","ko":"명성 2배 획득 이벤트!","zh":"雙倍聲望賽事！","zh_CN":"双倍声望赛事！","fi":"Tuplamaineosakilpailu!","sv":"Dubbel berömmelse-event!","da":"Event med dobbelt berømmelse!","no":"Doble ryktepoeng-arrangement!","pl":"Zawody z Podwójną Sławą!","pt_BR":"Evento Fama Dupla!","en":"Double Fame Event!","tr":"Çifte Ün Etkinliği!","es_MX":"¡Evento de Fama doble!","fr_CA":"Événement Réputation double","ar":"Double Fame Event!"},"description":{"ja":"Koenigseggマシンを使用して走れば名声ポイントが2倍もらえるので是非使おう。","en_US":"Take advantage of the Koenigsegg vehicles as they are all offering DOUBLE Fame!","fr":"Profitez des véhicules de Koenigsegg, elles offrent toutes de la réputation DOUBLE !","es":"¡Aprovecha los vehículos Koenigsegg, porque están ofreciendo el DOBLE de Fama!","de":"Nutze die Fahrzeuge von Koenigsegg zu deinem Vorteil, denn sie bieten alle DOPPELTEN Ruhm!","it":"Sfrutta le vetture Koenigsegg: offrono tutte DOPPIA fama!","nl":"Maak gebruik van de Koenigsegg voertuigen, want ze leveren allemaal dubbele roem op!","pt":"Tira todo o partido dos veículos da Koenigsegg, todos eles oferecem Prestígio DUPLO!","ru":"Пользуйтесь преимуществом Koenigsegg: на всех автомобилях этой марки вы получаете УДВОЕННУЮ славу!","ko":"명성을 2배로 획득할 수 있는 Koenigsegg 차량으로 주행하십시오.","zh":"快使用 Koenigsegg 系列的車輛，現在以此系列的任一車輛贏取賽事都能為你賺取雙倍的聲望！","zh_CN":"多使用 Koenigsegg 系列的车辆，以此系列的任一车辆赢取赛事都能为你赚取双倍的声望！","fi":"Ota hyöty irti Koenigsegg ajoneuvoista, sillä ne kaikki tuottavat TUPLASTI mainetta!","sv":"Du får dubbel berömmelse när du kör fordon från Koenigsegg!","da":"Benyt dig af Koenigsegg-køretøjerne, da de byder på DOBBELT berømmelse!","no":"Utnytt Koenigsegg-kjøretøyene, da de gir deg DOBBELT med ryktepoeng!","pl":"Siądź za sterami pojazdów klasy Koenigsegg i zdobądź PODWÓJNĄ liczbę punktów sławy!","pt_BR":"Aproveite os veículos da Koenigsegg, já que todos eles estão oferecendo Fama DUPLA!","en":"Take advantage of the Koenigsegg vehicles as they are all offering DOUBLE Fame!","tr":"İKİ KAT Ün sunan Koenigsegg araçların avantajından yararlanın!","es_MX":"¡Aprovecha los vehículos Koenigsegg, porque están ofreciendo el DOBLE de Fama!","fr_CA":"Profitez des véhicules de Koenigsegg, elles offrent toutes de la réputation DOUBLE !","ar":"Take advantage of the Koenigsegg vehicles as they are all offering DOUBLE Fame!"}},{"type":"TypeAlert","id":160401120000181200,"publishStartDate":1459512000590,"publishEndDate":1460980800590,"Image":"announcement_x2Fame","SmallImage":"announcement_816x128_x2Fame","fontSize":24,"titleId":"CUH-2XFAME","descriptionId":"","descriptionId2":"","descriptionId3":"","descriptionId4":"","title":{"ja":"名声ポイント2倍!","en_US":"DOUBLE FAME!","fr":"RÉPUTATION DOUBLE !","es":"¡DOBLE FAMA!","de":"DOPPELTER RUHM!","it":"DOPPIA FAMA!","nl":"DUBBELE ROEM!","pt":"PRESTÍGIO DUPLO!","ru":"УДВОЕНИЕ СЛАВЫ!","ko":"명성 2배!","zh":"雙倍聲望！","zh_CN":"双倍声望！","fi":"TUPLAMAINE!","sv":"DUBBEL BERÖMMELSE!","da":"DOBBELT BERØMMELSE!","no":"DOBBELT MED RYKTEPOENG!","pl":"PODWÓJNA SŁAWA!","pt_BR":"FAMA DUPLA!","en":"DOUBLE FAME!","tr":"İKİ KAT ÜN!","es_MX":"¡DOBLE FAMA!","fr_CA":"RÉPUTATION DOUBLE !","ar":"DOUBLE FAME!"},"description":{"ja":"Lamborghiniマシンを使用して走れば名声ポイントが2倍もらえるので是非使おう。","en_US":"Take advantage of the Lamborghini vehicles as they are all offering DOUBLE Fame!","fr":"Profitez des véhicules de Lamborghini, elles offrent toutes de la réputation DOUBLE !","es":"¡Aprovecha los vehículos Lamborghini, porque están ofreciendo el DOBLE de Fama!","de":"Nutze die Fahrzeuge von Lamborghini zu deinem Vorteil, denn sie bieten alle DOPPELTEN Ruhm!","it":"Sfrutta le vetture Lamborghini: offrono tutte DOPPIA fama!","nl":"Maak gebruik van de Lamborghini voertuigen, want ze leveren allemaal dubbele roem op!","pt":"Tira todo o partido dos veículos da Lamborghini, todos eles oferecem Prestígio DUPLO!","ru":"Пользуйтесь преимуществом Lamborghini: на всех автомобилях этой марки вы получаете УДВОЕННУЮ славу!","ko":"명성을 2배로 획득할 수 있는 Lamborghini 차량으로 주행하십시오.","zh":"快使用 Lamborghini 系列的車輛，現在以此系列的任一車輛贏取賽事都能為你賺取雙倍的聲望！","zh_CN":"多使用 Lamborghini 系列的车辆，以此系列的任一车辆赢取赛事都能为你赚取双倍的声望！","fi":"Ota hyöty irti Lamborghini ajoneuvoista, sillä ne kaikki tuottavat TUPLASTI mainetta!","sv":"Du får dubbel berömmelse när du kör fordon från Lamborghini!","da":"Benyt dig af Lamborghini-køretøjerne, da de byder på DOBBELT berømmelse!","no":"Utnytt Lamborghini-kjøretøyene, da de gir deg DOBBELT med ryktepoeng!","pl":"Siądź za sterami pojazdów klasy Lamborghini i zdobądź PODWÓJNĄ liczbę punktów sławy!","pt_BR":"Aproveite os veículos da Lamborghini, já que todos eles estão oferecendo Fama DUPLA!","en":"Take advantage of the Lamborghini vehicles as they are all offering DOUBLE Fame!","tr":"İKİ KAT Ün sunan Lamborghini araçların avantajından yararlanın!","es_MX":"¡Aprovecha los vehículos Lamborghini, porque están ofreciendo el DOBLE de Fama!","fr_CA":"Profitez des véhicules de Lamborghini, elles offrent toutes de la réputation DOUBLE !","ar":"Take advantage of the Lamborghini vehicles as they are all offering DOUBLE Fame!"}},{"type":"TypeAlert","id":160318120000301200,"publishStartDate":1460980800449,"